{
  "id": "E155",
  "title": "Buying Milk Tea",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-09-30",
  "synopsis": "Milk tea is very popular in China. Learn how to order it in Chinese.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/537/a86d59371d112b8629a74225e8159e8c661028d0.mp3?1506191403",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "买奶茶\n\n服务员：你好！你要喝点什么？\n安妮：我要一杯珍珠奶茶。\n服务员：你要热的还是冰的？\n安妮：我要冰的。还有，麻烦少加一点糖，我不喜欢太甜的。\n服务员：没问题，一杯冰珍珠奶茶，少糖。八块钱，谢谢。\n安妮：给。\n服务员：你的珍珠奶茶好了，现在喝还是带走？\n安妮：带走。\n服务员：好的，给你。欢迎下次再来！",
    "traditional": "買奶茶\n\n服務員：你好！你要喝點什麼？\n安妮：我要一杯珍珠奶茶。\n服務員：你要熱的還是冰的？\n安妮：我要冰的。還有，麻煩少加一點糖，我不喜歡太甜的。\n服務員：沒問題，一杯冰珍珠奶茶，少糖。八塊錢，謝謝。\n安妮：給。\n服務員：你的珍珠奶茶好了，現在喝還是帶走？\n安妮：帶走。\n服務員：好的，給你。歡迎下次再來！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Buying milk tea"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "服务员：你好！你要喝点什么？",
      "traditional": "服務員：你好！你要喝點什麼？",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán nǐ hǎo nǐ yào hē diǎn shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Hello! What would you like to drink?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "安妮：我要一杯珍珠奶茶。",
      "traditional": "安妮：我要一杯珍珠奶茶。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī wǒ yào yì bēi zhēn zhū nǎi chá",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: I would like a cup of bubble tea."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "服务员：你要热的还是冰的？",
      "traditional": "服務員：你要熱的還是冰的？",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán nǐ yào rè de hái shi bīng de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Do you want it hot or cold?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "安妮：我要冰的。还有，麻烦少加一点糖，我不喜欢太甜的。",
      "traditional": "安妮：我要冰的。還有，麻煩少加一點糖，我不喜歡太甜的。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī wǒ yào bīng de hái yǒu má fan shǎo jiā yì diǎn táng wǒ bù xǐ huan tài tián de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: I want it cold, and less sugar please. I don’t like too sweet drinks."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "服务员：没问题，一杯冰珍珠奶茶，少糖。八块钱，谢谢。",
      "traditional": "服務員：沒問題，一杯冰珍珠奶茶，少糖。八塊錢，謝謝。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán méi wèn tí yì bēi bīng zhēn zhū nǎi chá shǎo táng bā kuài qián xiè xie",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: No problem, a cup of cold bubble tea with less sugar. 8 kuai, please."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "安妮：给。",
      "traditional": "安妮：給。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī gěi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Here you are."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "服务员：你的珍珠奶茶好了，现在喝还是带走？",
      "traditional": "服務員：你的珍珠奶茶好了，現在喝還是帶走？",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán nǐ de zhēn zhū nǎi chá hǎo le xiàn zài hē hái shi dài zǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Your bubble tea is done. Do you want to drink it now or take away?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "安妮：带走。",
      "traditional": "安妮：帶走。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī dài zǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Take away."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "服务员：好的，给你。欢迎下次再来！",
      "traditional": "服務員：好的，給你。歡迎下次再來！",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán hǎo de gěi nǐ huān yíng xià cì zài lái",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Ok, here you are. Welcome back next time!"
    }
  ],
